      "text": "Section 1. There shall be four Deputy Mayors. One shall be designated the First Deputy Mayor, one shall be designated the Deputy Mayor for Housing and Economic Development, one shall be designated the Deputy Mayor for Health and Human Services, and one shall be designated the Deputy Mayor for Strategic Policy Initiatives.",
